      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Strumento dotato di capsula usato per catturare\nPokémon selvatici. Si lancia contro il bersaglio\ncome una palla.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A device for catching wild Pokémon. It’s thrown like\na ball at a Pokémon, comfortably encapsulating\nits target.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "野生の　ポケモンに　投げて\n捕まえるための　ボール。\nカプセル式に　なっている。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用于投向野生宝可梦\n并将其捕捉的球。\n它是胶囊样式的。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Dispositivo con diseño capsular que atrapa Pokémon\nsalvajes. Se lanza como una bola contra el blanco.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
